<!--
  仅作参考。Xcode 14+ 默认不再单独维护 Info.plist 文件,
  请把下面这条加到 Target 的 Build Settings → Info.plist Values
  或者点 Target → Info → Custom iOS Target Properties → "+":

  Key:    Privacy - Microphone Usage Description
  Value:  录制语音并发送给 ChatGPT
-->
<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
<string>录制语音并发送给 ChatGPT</string>
